  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving Communities&apos; Ecosystems and Livelihoods</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity aims to support communities in Fiji, Tonga, Vanuatu, Tuvalu, PNG and Solomon Islands to maintain and restore ecosystem services for food security, coastal protection and disaster risk reduction. By strengthening governance and improving gender and social inclusion, the activity improves community resilience and biodiversity. The activity also benefits communities&apos; water, sanitation and hygiene infrastructure and capability in four of these countries: Tonga, Vanuatu, Tuvalu and PNG.</narrative>
  </description>
